id: MOD5-2
package: fandhe-workshop-pack
test: round_slice_init
target: crates/core/src/begin.rs
find:     state.run.completed = false;
replace:     state.run.completed = false; state.run.slices.clear();
expect-fail: mod5_round1_slice_hashes_match_between_round1_end_and_round2_end
note: 次の周回の開始が前の周回の切り身を消す（2 周目の終了時に 1 周目の切り身のハッシュが変わる）
